{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34448","headline":"和袭美寒日书斋即事三首每篇各用一韵 三 · 陆龟蒙","name":"和袭美寒日书斋即事三首每篇各用一韵 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"名价皆酬百万余，尚怜方丈讲玄虚。\n西都宾问曾成赋，东海人求近着书。\n茅洞烟霞侵寤寐，檀溪风月挂樵渔。\n清朝还要廷臣在，两地宁容便结庐。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34448.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34448","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}